Package: Roryza
Description: An R/C++ implementation of the ORYZA rice crop growth model. ORYZA is a dynamic simulation model that uses daily weather data and crop, soil and management parameters to simulate rice growth and development. See Bouman et al. (2001) ORYZA2000: modeling lowland rice. IRRI / Wageningen University.
Type: Package
Title: ORYZA Rice Crop Growth Simulation Model
Version: 0.1-1
Date: 2026-09-08
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Imports: meteor, methods (>= 0.2-2), Rcpp (>= 0.12.4)
Suggests: tinytest, terra, raster
URL: https://github.com/cropmodels/Roryza
